        a: "Maintenance frequency depends on your vehicle manufacturer's schedule, engine type, oil specification, and driving conditions. Due to Dubai's sustained summer heat, stop-and-go traffic, and airborne dust, vehicles operate under severe-duty conditions. Fully synthetic engine oils typically require replacement every 8,000–10,000 km or 6 months, while semi-synthetic oils are usually changed every 5,000 km. Full and major services follow manufacturer intervals, commonly every 15,000 km and 30,000–40,000 km respectively."
