                            Regular scheduled maintenance is the most effective way to protect your car against premature wear, maintain fuel efficiency, and ensure driving safety. While standard owner handbooks assume moderate driving conditions, everyday motoring in Dubai involves high summer ambient temperatures, frequent stop-and-go highway traffic, airborne desert dust, and constant air conditioning load. These conditions place additional stress on motor oil, filtration media, cooling lines, and electrical components.
