                        <p class="dcrs-body-text">
                            Located at 222 Al Satwa Road, our garage services Japanese, European, American, and Asian marques using hydraulic lifts, multi-brand OBD diagnostic scanners, and dedicated fluid-servicing tools. For minor roadside issues or battery testing on location, drivers can also access our <a href="/mobile-car-repair-dubai" class="dcrs-inline-link">mobile car service</a> in selected central Dubai areas. To discuss your maintenance schedule or book an appointment, simply call our workshop or send us a WhatsApp message.
                        </p>

