                <p class="dcrs-pricing-disclaimer">
                    <Fragment set:html={icons.info} /> Starting prices apply to standard 4-cylinder petrol vehicles requiring up to 4 litres of standard oil. Vehicles with larger engine capacities (V6, V8, twin-turbo), European marques requiring specialized synthetic lubricants, or models needing platinum/iridium spark plugs are quoted transparently based on exact parts and volume specifications. All additional repairs require customer approval before work begins.
                </p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 4. SERVICE PROCESS ----------------------------------------------->
        <section class="dcrs-section dcrs-section--paper" id="process">
